3. Required prominent public promotion

Before your first operational use or redistribution under this license,
publish at least one publicly accessible acknowledgment that:

  (a) names POW and harnakam;
  (b) links to https://github.com/harnakam/POW; and
  (c) briefly and truthfully states that you use, redistribute, or modify POW.

Place this acknowledgment in the most prominent relevant public location:
the primary public introduction to your project, modified version, or use
of POW. Put it at the beginning of the main README, before installation or
usage instructions, or in the primary introductory area of the main website
or product page, visible without opening a separate credits or legal page.
Do not satisfy this condition solely with a footer, buried license notice,
collapsed section, or incidental social post.

For private work without a public project page, use a public introduction
that you control, such as the beginning of a personal website or a public
profile introduction. You need not identify or disclose the private work.
One such acknowledgment can cover continuing use and multiple versions;
keep it publicly accessible and prominently placed while that use or
redistribution continues. Repeated promotional posts are not required.
No positive review, star, rating, endorsement, account on a particular
service, or disclosure of private project information is required.

For example: "We use POW by harnakam: https://github.com/harnakam/POW".

